    ],
    "text": "FAUNA AND FLORA PROTECTION ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 469)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.13,
      374.17,
      547.12,
      397.24
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Tourism Development, Wildlife and Christian Religious Affairs underSection 71 of the Fauna and Flora Protection Ordinance (Chapter 469) read with Section 30 of the said Ordinance.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      380.37,
      410.17,
      547.03,
      445.24
    ],
    "text": "JOHN AMARATUNGA, Minister of Tourism Development,Wildlife and Christian Religious Affairs.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.13,
      458.17,
      137.12,
      481.84
    ],
    "text": "Colombo,30th January, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      274.65,
      496.57,
      328.65,
      507.64
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      56.13,
      522.37,
      547.05,
      546.28
    ],
    "text": "The Sea Mammals (Observation, Regulation and Control) Regulations No. 01 of 2012, published in the GazetteExtraordinary No. 1774/27 of September 06, 2012 are hereby amended as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      92.13,
      561.01,
      426.96,
      572.08
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the repeal of regulation 13 and the substitution therefor of the following :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      128.13,
      586.81,
      547.25,
      623.68
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(13) (1) Every person or group of persons who intends to observe sea mammals shall obtain apermit in that behalf from the Director-General or an officer authorized in that behalf by the Director-General who shall be present at the departure point for such purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      128.13,
      638.41,
      547.33,
      662.44
    ],
    "text": "(2) The person seeking to obtain a permit shall furnish information required in the form set outin Schedule IV.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      128.13,
      677.17,
      547.21,
      701.08
    ],
    "text": "(3) The permit so issued shall be in the form set out in Schedule V. The permit shall be issuedon payment of a specified fee as set out in Schedule VI.\u201d ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      92.13,
      715.81,
      450.96,
      726.88
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the repeal of Schedule V thereof and the substitution therefor of the following :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      737.27,
      147.56,
      746.13
    ],
    "text": "1A PG 3877\u2014 492 (01/2019)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      49.15,
      83.29,
      508.19,
      104.37
    ],
