    "text": "FAUNA AND FLORA PROTECTION ORDINANCE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      118.63,
      166.69,
      469.01,
      177.76
    ],
    "text": "PERMIT ISSUED FOR THE PURPOSE OF OBSERVING SEA MAMMALS",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.83,
      192.49,
      539.89,
      229.36
    ],
    "text": "Mr./Mrs............................................................................................of ............................................................................................and/or/your group consisting of..................................persons are hereby permitted to observe sea-mammals using the vesselbearing Licence No..............................in the zone of............................. between 5.30 a.m. to 7.00 p.m. on...........................",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      266.83,
      244.98,
      320.83,
      254.94
    ],
    "text": "CONDITIONS",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      73.63,
      269.89,
      529.69,
      280.96
    ],
    "text": "(i) The permit holder/holders shall use only the permitted sea zone for the purpose of watching sea-mammals.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      70.63,
      295.69,
      359.85,
      306.76
    ],
    "text": "(ii) No unauthorized person should be carried in the permitted vessel.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      67.63,
      321.49,
      431.25,
      332.56
    ],
    "text": "(iii) Watching of mammals should be done only during the prescribed times of the date.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.43,
      347.29,
      535.71,
      358.36
    ],
    "text": "(iv) While watching mammals, anything detrimental to the natural existence of sea mammals should not be done.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.43,
      373.09,
      407.86,
      384.16
    ],
    "text": "(v) While watching mammals, food substances should not be thrown into the sea.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      69.43,
      398.89,
      221.25,
      409.96
    ],
    "text": "(vi) This permit cannot be alienated.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      66.43,
      424.69,
      540.03,
      435.76
    ],
    "text": "(vii) The permit holder or permit holders should be subject to rules, regulations and conditions imposed under Fauna",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      89.83,
      437.65,
      283.07,
      448.72
    ],
    "text": "and Flora Protection Ordinance (Chapter 469).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      261.79,
      463.45,
      325.99,
      474.52
